AccrueInterestTest
├── given market is paused
│   └── it should revert
└── given market is not paused
    ├── when total borrowed is zero
    │   └── it should not accrue interest
    └── when total borrowed is greater than zero
        ├── when borrow rate is zero
        │   └── it should not accrue interest
        └── when borrow rate is greater than zero
            └── it should accrue interest 